```dart
class Transaction {
  final String coinName;
  final DateTime datetime;
  final double profitOrLoss;

  const Transaction({required this.coinName, required this.datetime, required this.profitOrLoss});
}
```

2. Create a list of transactions as an example data source. Here's one possible implementation:

```dart
final List<Transaction> transactions = [
  Transaction(coinName: 'BTC', datetime: DateTime(2021, 8, 1), profitOrLoss: 500),
